  <div>
    <div class="cover-title"><span class="y">HUMANIZING</span><br>AN AI-DRIVEN<br>WORLD.</div>
    <div class="cover-subtitle">Interesting is the most profitable thing a brand can be.</div>
  </div>
  <div class="cover-bottom">
